# .dockerignore — 排除不需要复制进 Docker 镜像的文件
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
**/.gitkeep

# 原始数据（太大，需挂载卷）
data/raw/
input/

# 生成物（构建时重新生成）
figs/*.png
figs/*.pdf
figs/*.svg

# 临时文件
#
# `*.log` is deliberately NOT excluded any more (2026-10-06). The repository tracks
# 18 `.log` files under docs/audit_notes/, and `metadata/provenance.json` — the manifest
# that `scripts/verify_provenance.py` (gate 3) and `scripts/check_audit_manifests.py`
# (gate 13) check against — hashes every one of them. Excluding them from the build
# context therefore produced an image in which two of the archive's own gates cannot pass,
# while nothing in the image's ENTRYPOINT ever said so. The files are small; the gates
# matter more.
*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 本地环境
.env
venv/
.venv/
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# 压缩包
*.tar.gz
*.zip
analyses_logs.zip
